{"id":"b7d1cc28-cd8b-4d5a-aad7-374cc1ce00cf","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:44:35.525Z","batchId":"login_qwen3-8-flash-opencode-go_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Account</span>\n    <h1>Welcome back</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Sign in to your Northbeam workspace to continue.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width: 24rem; margin-inline: auto; width: 100%;\">\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"background:#6366f1;color:#fff;\">N</div>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Secure sign-in · TLS 1.3</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"formAlert\"></div>\n\n    <form id=\"loginForm\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" novalidate autocomplete=\"on\">\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <label for=\"email\">\n          Email address\n          <input id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\"\n                 autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" required>\n        </label>\n        <span id=\"emailError\" class=\"small down\" hidden>Enter a valid email address.</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <span class=\"stat-label\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">Password</span>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">Forgot password?</a>\n        </div>\n        <label for=\"password\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <input id=\"password\" name=\"password\" type=\"password\"\n                   autocomplete=\"current-password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" required style=\"flex:1;\">\n            <button type=\"button\" id=\"togglePw\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" aria-label=\"Show password\">Show</button>\n          </div>\n        </label>\n        <span id=\"pwError\" class=\"small down\" hidden>Password must be at least 8 characters.</span>\n        <span id=\"capsHint\" class=\"small down\" hidden>Caps Lock is on.</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <label class=\"check\" for=\"remember\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\" name=\"remember\" checked>\n        <span>Remember me on this device</span>\n      </label>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Keeps you signed in for 30 days. Avoid using on shared or public computers.</span>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block\" id=\"signInBtn\">Sign in</button>\n        <span id=\"statusNote\" class=\"small muted\" role=\"status\">\n          Using <strong>Q3 migration</strong> credentials? Sign in with your SSO email.\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n    </form>\n\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"center stack gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Don&rsquo;t have an account?</span>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">Request workspace access</a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const form = document.getElementById('loginForm');\n  const email = document.getElementById('email');\n  const password = document.getElementById('password');\n  const emailError = document.getElementById('emailError');\n  const pwError = document.getElementById('pwError');\n  const capsHint = document.getElementById('capsHint');\n  const alertBox = document.getElementById('formAlert');\n  const signInBtn = document.getElementById('signInBtn');\n  const togglePw = document.getElementById('togglePw');\n\n  togglePw.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    const show = password.type === 'password';\n    password.type = show ? 'text' : 'password';\n    togglePw.textContent = show ? 'Hide' : 'Show';\n    togglePw.setAttribute('aria-label', show ? 'Hide password' : 'Show password');\n  });\n\n  password.addEventListener('keyup', function (e) {\n    if (e.getModifierState) capsHint.hidden = !e.getModifierState('CapsLock');\n  });\n  password.addEventListener('blur', function () { capsHint.hidden = true; });\n\n  function validEmail(v) { return /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(v); }\n\n  function clearAlert() { alertBox.innerHTML = ''; }\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    clearAlert();\n    let ok = true;\n\n    if (!validEmail(email.value.trim())) { emailError.hidden = false; ok = false; }\n    else emailError.hidden = true;\n\n    if (password.value.length < 8) { pwError.hidden = false; ok = false; }\n    else pwError.hidden = true;\n\n    if (!ok) {\n      alertBox.innerHTML = '<div class=\"alert alert-destructive\">Check the highlighted fields and try again.</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    signInBtn.disabled = true;\n    signInBtn.textContent = 'Signing in\\u2026';\n    setTimeout(function () {\n      signInBtn.disabled = false;\n      signInBtn.textContent = 'Sign in';\n      const who = email.value.trim();\n      const keep = document.getElementById('remember').checked;\n      alertBox.innerHTML = '<div class=\"alert\">Signed in as <strong>' + who +\n        '</strong>' + (keep ? ' &mdash; session will be remembered for 30 days.' : ' &mdash; this session only.') + '</div>';\n    }, 900);\n  });\n\n  email.addEventListener('input', function () { emailError.hidden = true; });\n  password.addEventListener('input', function () { pwError.hidden = true; });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[5801,"<div class=\"stack"],[5920," gap-lg\">\n\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n"],[6186,"    <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Account</span>\n    <h1"],[6439,">Welcome back</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Sign in to"],[6735," your Northbeam workspace to continue.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div"],[6907," class=\"card stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width:"],[7179," 24rem; margin-inline: auto; width: 100%;\">\n\n    <div class"],[7444,"=\"row between\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\""],[7676," style=\"background:#6366"],[7783,"f1;color:#fff;\">N</div>\n"],[7994,"      <span class=\"small muted\">Secure sign-in · TLS 1.3"],[8207,"</span>\n    </div"],[8328,">\n\n    <div id=\"formAlert\"></div>\n\n   "],[8446," <form id=\"loginForm\" class=\"stack gap-lg"],[8607,"\" novalidate autocomplete"],[8721,"=\"on\">\n\n      <div class=\"stack"],[8907," gap-sm\">\n        <label for=\"email\">\n          Email address\n          <input"],[9018," id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" inputmode=\""],[9217,"email\"\n                 autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you"],[9343,"@company.com\" required>\n        </label>\n        <span id"],[9600,"=\"emailError\" class=\"small down\" hidden>Enter a valid email address.</span>\n"],[9800,"      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">"],[9960,"\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <span class=\""],[10086,"stat-label\" style=\""],[10254,"font-size:0.8rem;\">Password</span>\n"],[10384,"          <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\" style=\"text"],[10525,"-decoration:none;\">Forgot password?</a>\n        </div"],[10660,">\n        <label for=\"password\" style=\"margin-top"],[10884,":0;\">\n"],[11020,"          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <input"],[11183," id=\"password\" name=\"password\" type=\"password"],[11303,"\"\n                   autocomplete=\"current-password\" placeholder=\"••••••••"],[11588,"\" required style=\"flex:1;\">\n"],[11776,"   